{"4005900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Froggin' Around", "steam_appid": 4005900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Froggin' Around is a <strong>FROG-TABULOUS, </strong>two player, co-op only experience. <strong>🐸</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as two <strong>FROGS</strong> on a magical quest.✨</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together and use your <strong>FROG POWERS </strong>to progress and solve puzzles through this colorful fantasy world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embody a frog 🐸</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crawl around, stretch your tongue,  croak and eat flies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005900/extras/c6c8364fc3d4181ac1577e93c0f898e4.poster.avif?t=1770494372\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005900/extras/c6c8364fc3d4181ac1577e93c0f898e4.webm?t=1770494372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005900/extras/c6c8364fc3d4181ac1577e93c0f898e4.mp4?t=1770494372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cooperate 🤝</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collaborate with your partner to solve clever puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005900/extras/9f9154b7893b5d6f382fbb4185a0b344.poster.avif?t=1770494372\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005900/extras/9f9154b7893b5d6f382fbb4185a0b344.webm?t=1770494372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005900/extras/9f9154b7893b5d6f382fbb4185a0b344.mp4?t=1770494372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a magical world 🔮</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the wizard's workshop to the glowing sewers, travel through a variety of unusual locations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find bouncy mushrooms, flying books and other intriguing objects on your path</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005900/extras/385a51f53c9f20bd3617c6cbda11b58e.poster.avif?t=1770494372\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005900/extras/385a51f53c9f20bd3617c6cbda11b58e.webm?t=1770494372\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005900/extras/385a51f53c9f20bd3617c6cbda11b58e.mp4?t=1770494372\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Froggin' Around is a <strong>FROG-TABULOUS, </strong>two player, co-op only experience. <strong>🐸</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as two <strong>FROGS</strong> on a magical quest.✨</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together and use your <strong>FROG POWERS </strong>to progress and solve puzzles through this colorful fantasy world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Embody a frog 🐸</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crawl around, stretch your tongue,  croak and eat flies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005900/extras/c6c8364fc3d4181ac1577e93c0f898e4.poster.avif?t=1770494372\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_